{"id":"word:hebrew:H120","type":"word","title":"אָדָם","subtitle":"H120 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"ruddy i.e. a human being (an individual or the species, mankind , etc.)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אָדָם (H120) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 552 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אָדָם (ʼâdâm) means ruddy i.e. a human being (an individual or the species, mankind , etc.) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 21."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אָדָם","transliteration":"ʼâdâm","pronunciation":"aw-dawm'","strong":"H120","lemmaId":"hebrew:H120","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["אָדָ֖ם","אָדָ֗ם","אָדָֽם","אָדָ֔ם","אָדָ֕ם"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",337],["HTd/Ncmsa",137],["HRd/Ncmsa",31],["HR/Ncmsa",30],["HC/Ncmsa",9],["HC/R/Ncmsa",3],["HTi/Ncmsa",1],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",1],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",1],["HR/R/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"ruddy i.e. a human being (an individual or the species, mankind , etc.)","usage":"× another, hypocrite, common sort, × low, man (mean, of low degree), person.","full":"H120. adam אָדָם 560 noun masculine Gen 1:27 man, mankind (Phoenician אדם , Sabean id. , CIS iv.1,l.4 and others; compare Assyrian admu , young (of bird) Dl W , but Nö ZMG 1886, 722 identification with Arabic collective creatures ) — Singular absolute except construct Prov 6:12 compare Thes; ( (הָ)א ׳בְּנֵי often = plural of ׳א Gen 11:5 39t., compare הָא ׳בְּנוֺת 6:2 , 4 ) &#8212; 1 a man (= German Mensch ) = human being Gen 2:5 , 7 (twice in verse); 2:8 , 15 , 16 , 18 +, 16:12 (27 t. J) Lev 5:4 || נֶמֶּשׁ 13:2 , 9 (19 t. P) Neh 2:10 ; Isa 13:12 (|| אֱנוֺשׁ ); ׳הָאָ הַגָּדוֺל Josh 14:15 (E); ׳אָ בְּלִיַּעַל Prov 6:12 (|| אָוֶן אִישׁ compare 1Sam 25:25 & see בליעל ); = any one Lev 1:2 ; Num 9:6-7 , Job 20:29 ; 27:13 ; Prov 15:20 ; 21:16 , 20 ; 24:30 ; Eccl 7:20 + often Wisdom Literature, Jer 2:6 ; 4:25 ; Neh 2:12 , compare א ׳נֶמֶּשׁ Num 19:11 , 13 +; seldom man opposed to woman Gen 2:22 (twice in verse); 2:23 , 25 ; 3:8 , 12 , 17 , 20 , 21 ; Eccl 7:28 . 2 collective man, mankind Gen 1:26 ; 9:5-6 , (3 t. in verse) + (P 28 t.) 6:1 , 5 , 6 , 7 (J E 24 t.) Deut 4:32 (D 6 t.) (on 2Sam 7:19 compare 1Chr 17:17 see Dr Sm ); distinctly = men + women Gen 1:27 ; 5:1 ; Num 5:6 ; given as name Gen 5:2 ; but = warriors Isa 22:6 א ׳רֶכֶב || (מּרשׁיםׅ ; || beasts (41 t.) בְּהֵמָה Gen 6:7 ; 7:23 (J ?) Exod 8:13 ; 8:14 ; 9:9-10 , (P) 9:19 , 22 , 25 ; 12:12 ; 13:2 , 13 , 15 (all J) +; late prophets Jer 21:6 ; 31:27 ; 50:3 ; 51:62 ; Ezek 14:13 , 17 , 19 , 21 ; 25:13 ; 29:8 , 11 ; 32:13 (strike out Co) 36:11 ; Jonah 3:8 ; Zeph 1:3 ; Hag 1:11 ; Zech 2:8 ; 8:10 ; || בָּקָר Ezek 4:15 ; || ׳ב חֲמֹרִים צֹאן, Num 31:28 ; || id. + מִכָּלהַֿבְּהֵמָה 31:30 compare Jonah 3:7 ; || חַיָּה Gen 9:5 (P) compare Ezek 1:5 , 8 , 10 , 26 , & description of כְּרוּבִים 10:8 , 14 , 21 ; compare 41:19 ; || trees Deut 20:19 (read הֶאָדָם see Di); opposed to God 1Sam 15:29 ; 16:7 (twice in verse); Isa 31:3 ; Ezek 28:2 , 9 ; 1Chr 21:13 ; 29:1 ; 2Chr 6:18 ; Mal 3:8 compare Exod 33:20 ; Deut 5:21 ; so ׳בֶּןאֿ Num 23:19 (|| אישׁ ) Ezek 2:1 , 3 , 6 , 8 (87 t. Ezekiel, always addressed to prophet); ׳הָא בְּנֵי 1Sam 26:19 ; made in God's image Gen 1:26-27 , 9:6 compare Eccl 7:29 ; as feeble, earthly, mortal Num 16:29 (twice in verse); Psa 82:7 ; 144:3 ; 144:4 ; Job 5:7 ; 14:1 , 10 ; compare 25:6 ( ׳בֶּןאֿ ) Eccl 12:5 ; as sinful 1Kin 8:46 ; 2Chr 6:36 ; Jer 10:14 compare Num 5:6 ; Job 31:33 ; Hosea 6:7 ; of men in General, other men (opposed to particular ones) Judg 16:17 (compare הָא ׳אַחַד 16:7 ; 16:11 ) 18:7 , 28 ; Psa 73:5 ; Jer 32:20 +; || אִישׁ Isa 2:9 , 11 , 17 ; 5:15 compare Ezek 23:42 (strike out Co Vrss); א ׳בְּנֵי 2Sam 7:14 (|| אֲנָשִׁים ) Prov 8:4 (|| אִישִׁים ); Psa 49:3 ; 62:10 (both || אִישׁ בְּנֵי ) = men of low opposed to men of high degree — so often Phoenician and = vassal Sabean DHM ZMG 1875, 680 compare 686; א ׳נֶפֶשׁ coll